{"id":"866d47bca0b3782c","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-atom-family-mgu.md","title":"同谓词原子族的最一般统一","display":"df-atom-family-mgu — 同谓词原子族的最一般统一","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-atom-family-mgu","aliases":["72-df-atom-family-mgu"],"display":"df-atom-family-mgu — 同谓词原子族的最一般统一","depends_on":["[[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]]","[[72-df-first-order-clause]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §§2.6.1–2.6.2 print59–61/PDF71–73; local finite-family interface","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-atom-family-mgu"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-atom-family-mgu</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-atom-family-mgu — 同谓词原子族的最一般统一"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"03ecee8b72b25180\" href=\"?note=03ecee8b72b25180\" title=\"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier\">72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d1d3b024cc821344\" href=\"?note=d1d3b024cc821344\" title=\"72-df-first-order-clause\">72-df-first-order-clause</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §§2.6.1–2.6.2 print59–61/PDF71–73; local finite-family interface"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d1d3b024cc821344\" href=\"?note=d1d3b024cc821344\" title=\"72-df-first-order-clause\">72-df-first-order-clause</a> 沿用的同一签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}=R\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}=R\\)</span>、项集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(T=\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 及正原子集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MGU}\">\\(\\operatorname{MGU}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"03ecee8b72b25180\" href=\"?note=03ecee8b72b25180\" title=\"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier\">72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier</a> 的该签名实例。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne K\\subseteq\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne K\\subseteq\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_K\">\\(E_K\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MGUAts}\">\\(\\operatorname{MGUAts}\\)</span> 由下式定义；只有谓词相同的原子才对齐项坐标。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_K:=\\{\\langle t_i,u_i\\rangle:P\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},\\ \\vec t,\\vec u\\in T^{a_R(P)},\\ P(\\vec t)\\in K,\\ P(\\vec u)\\in K,\\ i&lt;a_R(P)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_K:=\\{\\langle t_i,u_i\\rangle:P\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},\\ \\vec t,\\vec u\\in T^{a_R(P)},\\ P(\\vec t)\\in K,\\ P(\\vec u)\\in K,\\ i&lt;a_R(P)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MGUAts}(K,\\theta):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\ (K\\subseteq\\{P(\\vec t):\\vec t\\in T^{a_R(P)}\\})\\land\\operatorname{MGU}(E_K,\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MGUAts}(K,\\theta):\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\ (K\\subseteq\\{P(\\vec t):\\vec t\\in T^{a_R(P)}\\})\\land\\operatorname{MGU}(E_K,\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MGUAts}(K,\\theta)\\Longrightarrow|\\{A\\theta:A\\in K\\}|=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MGUAts}(K,\\theta)\\Longrightarrow|\\{A\\theta:A\\in K\\}|=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>K有限且所有元数有限，所以E_K为有限项对集；取全部成对坐标无需任选一个基准原子。最一般性完全复用已有有限项方程组契约，不在此另行声称MGU存在。最后式由每对坐标在θ下相同及K非空得到。不同谓词的族明确不能满足本谓词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier","status":"resolved","id":"03ecee8b72b25180","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-first-order-clause","status":"resolved","id":"d1d3b024cc821344","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-first-order-clause","status":"resolved","id":"d